===Intransitive verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To become spread by smearing.
#:''The paint is still wet &mdash; don't touch it or it will smear.''

===Noun===
'''smear''' (''plural'' '''smears''')

# A mark made by smearing.
#:''This detergent cleans windows without leaving smears.''
# {{medicine}} A [[Pap smear]].
#:''I'm going to the doctor's this afternoon for a smear.''

====Synonyms====
*(''mark''): [[streak]]
*(''Pap smear''): [[Pap smear]], [[Pap test]]

